@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Typed AST may-happen-in-parallel analysis

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #343A40
  FontColor #212529
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "CPG AST overlay\nBlock + MsgKind::Spawn" as INPUT #DBE4FF
component "Stable direct children\noperand roots (direct or wrapped)" as OPERANDS #FFF3BF
component "Cycle-guarded subtree walks\nstop at nested Function" as WALK #C3FAE8
component "Execution sites\nstatements + explicit executable kinds" as SITES #D3F9D8
component "Distinct-operand cross-products\n<latex>S(o_i) \\times S(o_j), i \\ne j</latex>" as PRODUCT #E5DBFF
component "Canonical ordered set\n(min id, max id)" as CANON #FFE8CC
component "MAX_MHP_PAIRS budget\nvisible truncation" as BOUND #FCC2D7
component "MhpRelation\nsorted pairs + capped flag" as OUTPUT #FFE3E3

INPUT --> OPERANDS : typed boundary only
OPERANDS --> WALK : one traversal per operand
WALK --> SITES : filter structural nodes
SITES --> PRODUCT : pair different operands
PRODUCT --> CANON : symmetric deduplication
CANON --> BOUND : count materialized pairs
BOUND --> OUTPUT : complete or capped

note bottom of INPUT
  No source parsing and no grammar dependency.
end note

note bottom of OUTPUT
  Read-only advisory evidence. MHP is not by itself a data-race finding.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| typed frontend evidence |
|<#FFF3BF>| AST operand boundary |
|<#C3FAE8>| terminating traversal |
|<#D3F9D8>| execution-site selection |
|<#E5DBFF>| relation construction |
|<#FFE8CC>| deterministic canonicalization |
|<#FCC2D7>| resource safety boundary |
|<#FFE3E3>| immutable public result |
endlegend
@enduml
